# Example S7comm TPKT/COTP frames for the s7comm-dpi decoder.
#
# TPKT 03 00 <len> | COTP 02 F0 80 | S7 32 01 ... | function at offset 17.

# Documented Read Var job (function 0x04): Merker byte 368, two bytes.
0300001F02F08032010000026B000E00000401120A10020002000083000170

# Request Download (function 0x1A, 26): a program block is pushed to the PLC.
0300001202F08032010000026C000100001A

# Start Upload (function 0x1D, 29): a program block is read back from the PLC.
0300001202F08032010000026D000100001D

# PLC Stop (function 0x29, 41): the controller is switched out of RUN.
0300001202F08032010000026E0001000029
